IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EMP-SALARY-PROCESSOR.
AUTHOR. AI-COLLABORATOR.
DATE-WRITTEN. 2026-10-07.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO "EMPLOYEES.DAT"
ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO "SALARY_REPORT.TXT"
ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD EMPLOYEE-FILE.
01 EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
05 EMP-ID PIC X(5).
05 EMP-NAME PIC X(20).
05 EMP-HOURS PIC 9(3)V99. > T.ex. 160.50 timmar
05 EMP-HOURLY-RATE PIC 9(3)V99. > T.ex. 025.50 kr/h
FD REPORT-FILE.
01 REPORT-RECORD PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
> Statusflaggor och beräkningsvariabler
01 WS-FLAGS.
05 FS-END-OF-FILE PIC X(3) VALUE "NO ".
88 END-OF-FILE VALUE "YES".
01 WS-COUNTERS.
05 WS-TOTAL-EMPLOYEES PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
05 WS-TOTAL-PAYOUT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-CALCULATIONS.
05 WS-GROSS-PAY PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
> Layout för rapportens rubrik
01 HEADER-LINE-1.
05 FILLER PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
05 FILLER PIC X(30) VALUE "LÖNERAPPORT FÖR ANSTÄLLDA".
05 FILLER PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
01 HEADER-LINE-2.
05 FILLER PIC X(8) VALUE "ID ".
05 FILLER PIC X(22) VALUE "NAMN ".
05 FILLER PIC X(12) VALUE "TIMMAR ".
05 FILLER PIC X(12) VALUE "TIMLÖN ".
05 FILLER PIC X(15) VALUE "BRUTTOLÖN ".
01 DASH-LINE.
05 FILLER PIC X(80) VALUE ALL "-".
> Layout för datarader (Använder maskering/editerade fält)
01 DETAIL-LINE.
05 DET-ID PIC X(5).
05 FILLER PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
05 DET-NAME PIC X(20).
05 FILLER PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
05 DET-HOURS PIC ZZZ.99.
05 FILLER PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
05 DET-RATE PIC ZZZ.99.
05 FILLER PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
05 DET-GROSS PIC ZZ,ZZZ.99.
> Layout för sammanfattningsraden längst ner
01 SUMMARY-LINE.
05 FILLER PIC X(30) VALUE "TOTALT UTBETALAT: ".
05 SUM-TOTAL-PAY PIC $ZZZ,ZZZ.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PROCEDURE.
PERFORM 100-INITIALIZE.
PERFORM 200-PROCESS-DATA UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
PERFORM 300-TERMINATE.
STOP RUN.
100-INITIALIZE.
OPEN INPUT EMPLOYEE-FILE.
OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE.
> Skriv ut rubrikerna till rapportfilen
WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM HEADER-LINE-1.
WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM HEADER-LINE-2.
WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM DASH-LINE.
> Läs den första posten i filen
READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
AT END MOVE "YES" TO FS-END-OF-FILE
END-READ.
200-PROCESS-DATA.
> 1. Beräkna bruttolön (Timmar Timlön)
MULTIPLY EMP-HOURS BY EMP-HOURLY-RATE
GIVING WS-GROSS-PAY.
> 2. Ackumulera totalen
ADD WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-TOTAL-PAYOUT.
ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL-EMPLOYEES.
> 3. Flytta data till rapportlayouten (Nollor rensas bort av Z-masken)
MOVE EMP-ID TO DET-ID.
MOVE EMP-NAME TO DET-NAME.
MOVE EMP-HOURS TO DET-HOURS.
MOVE EMP-HOURLY-RATE TO DET-RATE.
MOVE WS-GROSS-PAY TO DET-GROSS.
> 4. Skriv raden till rapporten
WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM DETAIL-LINE.
> 5. Läs nästa rad från indatafilen
READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
AT END MOVE "YES" TO FS-END-OF-FILE
END-READ.
300-TERMINATE.
> Skriv sammanfattning
WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM DASH-LINE.
MOVE WS-TOTAL-PAYOUT TO SUM-TOTAL-PAY.
WRITE REPORT-RECORD FROM SUMMARY-LINE.
> Stäng filer
CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE.
CLOSE REPORT-FILE.
DISPLAY "Processen klar. " WS-TOTAL-EMPLOYEES " anställda hanterade.".
